# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# Web3Forms access key — free tier, handles attachments.
# Get one at https://web3forms.com by entering the ECS inbox address; the key
# arrives by email. It is a public-by-design key: it only ever posts to the
# address it was issued for, which is why it is safe in a static build.
#
# Until this is set, the Email and "Call me back" paths on /contact say so
# plainly and disable themselves. WhatsApp keeps working either way.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
